## Why This Is Asked
Tests practical ingestion patterns and lightweight, maintainable data quality at the edge using Cloud Functions, Pub/Sub, and BigQuery, suitable for beginners.

## Key Concepts
- Pub/Sub trigger patterns and function-based validation
- Minimal schema enforcement and error routing
- Streaming inserts to BigQuery vs batch loads
- Data lineage between RAW and CLEAN tables
- Deduplication strategy using stable keys

